      "findings": "Retailer review junip:13200181; actor 215817888; published 2026-05-10T02:01:45.837Z. Softwear–Void, version unknown: lid repeatedly unscrews; pocket leakage at work stained underwear, shirt and jeans, with unrecoverable product and costly loss. Suggests click-lock/doe-foot alternatives. Loves product, Void is favorite, explicitly will repurchase despite annoyance. Three stars; would_recommend=true; verified_buyer=true; rewarded=false; review engagement unavailable. In-use leakage, not arrival testimony; repetition does not quantify incidents. Cross-platform actor overlap unverified."
